# Image to analyse
sensor_msgs/Image image
# Classes to look for (optional).
#  - open-vocabulary detector: free-text prompts (e.g. "red mug", "keys").
#    If empty, the default classes from the node configuration are used.
#  - classic detector: optional filter on its fixed label set (e.g. COCO).
#    If empty, all the classes are returned. Unknown names are ignored.
string[] classes
---
pepper_interfaces/Detection[] detections
